---
// /blog/late-night-food/ — AGENTS.md-bound slug (v1 URL stub points here).
//
// Hours corrected by owner 2026-07-30: the kitchen is open till 11:30 PM
// (config is the source of truth), and AFTER close it still takes BIG orders
// by phone — higher charges, limited late menu (mostly pizza, sandwiches,
// fries). That makes this post a genuine "latest kitchen in town" claim
// instead of the earlier plan-around-9-PM framing.
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogPostLayout from '../../components/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import { site, deliveryFreeAboveLine } from '../../lib/data';
import { LINKS, abs, blogPostingJsonLd, breadcrumbJsonLd } from '../../lib/seo';

const headline = 'Late-Night Food in Sundargarh: We Cook Till 11:30 PM';
const description =
  'Most Sundargarh kitchens shut by 9. The Oven Vibe takes orders till 11:30 PM every day — and arranges big late-night orders by phone even after that.';
const image = {
  url: abs('/static/images/og/blog_3.jpg'),
  width: 1200,
  height: 630,
  alt: 'Late-night pure veg food in Sundargarh',
};
const path = '/blog/late-night-food/';
---

<Layout
  title={headline}
  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  image={image}
  jsonLd={[
    blogPostingJsonLd({
      headline,
      description,
      path,
      image: image.url,
      datePublished: '2024-05-25',
    }),
    breadcrumbJsonLd([
      { name: 'Blog', path: '/blog/' },
      { name: 'Late-Night Food', path },
    ]),
  ]}
>
  <BlogPostLayout
    line1="LATE-NIGHT"
    lineGradient="FOOD."
    subtitle="How to eat well late in Sundargarh — and when to place the order."
  >
    <p class="subtitle" style="font-weight: 600; color: #555; margin-top: -10px">
      Raat ke time kya order karein?
    </p>

    <picture>
      <source type="image/avif" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_3.avif" />
      <source type="image/webp" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_3.webp" />
      <img
        src="/static/images/blog_images/blog_3.webp"
        alt="Late-night pure veg food in Sundargarh"
        class="blog-img"
        loading="lazy"
        width="1024"
        height="1024"
        style="background: #eee"
      />
    </picture>

    <p>
      Anyone who has been hungry in Sundargarh at half past nine knows the problem: the hunger is at
      full strength and the options are not. Shutters are down, kitchens are cleaned — and this is
      exactly the hour our ovens are still on.
    </p>

    <h2>First, the honest part about our timings</h2>
    <p>
      The Oven Vibe is open {site.business.hours.display} — one of the latest-running kitchens in
      town. Place your order by about 11 PM and you are comfortably inside the window for a hot
      delivery. And if the party runs past closing: we take <strong>big orders even after 11:30
      PM</strong> — call to arrange it. Late-night charges are higher and the late menu is limited
      (mostly pizzas, grilled sandwiches and fries), but the oven is genuinely still on.
    </p>

    <h2>Who orders late, and why planning helps</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Hostel students and bachelors, after study or a shift</li>
      <li>Night-shift workers eating before or after work</li>
      <li>Movie nights and gaming sessions that run long</li>
      <li>Anyone who skipped a proper dinner and regretted it near midnight</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What to order for later, not just for now</h2>
    <p>
      Not everything survives an hour on a table. These hold up best if you will be eating a while
      after it arrives:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Pizzas</strong> — reheat well in a pan, and the paneer ones stay soft instead of going
        rubbery.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Fried rice bowls</strong> — the most forgiving thing on the menu, and filling enough to
        be an actual dinner.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Fries and potato pops</strong> — best eaten immediately, so order these only if you are
        eating straight away.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Meal box combos</strong> — one box, nothing to assemble, ideal when you cannot be
        bothered to think about it.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <h2>Ordering late, done right</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Call or message by 11 PM for a comfortable same-night delivery.</li>
        <li>
          After 11:30 PM: big orders only, arranged by phone — higher charges, limited menu (pizzas,
          sandwiches, fries).
        </li>
        <li>
          A group order that clears the {deliveryFreeAboveLine.toLowerCase()} threshold pays no delivery
          charge, which is usually the cheapest way to feed four people.
        </li>
        <li>Collecting yourself? Takeaway is ready in about 20 minutes.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #ad210a">
        Everything is 100% pure veg — no exceptions, at any hour.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>The last bite</h2>
    <p>
      Late hunger in Sundargarh finally has an answer that isn't biscuits. Keep the
      <a href="/menu/">menu</a> handy, know
      <a href="/sundargarh/">the delivery charge for your area</a>, and remember the two numbers that
      matter: regular orders till 11:30 PM, big orders by phone after.
    </p>

    <a href={`tel:${site.business.phone}`} class="cta">
      Call the Kitchen: {site.business.phone_display}
    </a>
    <p>
      Prefer to type? <a href={LINKS.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >Order on WhatsApp</a
      >.
    </p>
  </BlogPostLayout>
</Layout>
